'''Dusknoir''' (Japanese: '''ヨノワール''' ''Yonoir'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

