===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Dusknoir|53}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*'''Hammer In''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Larvitar|87}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

